ident  of the United States meet them on the  aircraft and walk with them just hours  after greeting the freed prisoners  President Trump tweeted that his  historic summit with Kim jong-un will  take place in Singh  poor on June 12th I'll be meeting with  kim jonghwan to pursue a future of peace  and security for the world for the whole  world the White House says the  president's goal at this summit is  complete irreversible and verifiable  denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula  the white house warns that any  provocative action by North Korea over  the next month could scuttle this  much-anticipated  summit Nora all right Paula thank you so  much
 

